# tests/merge-harness, as an ENTRY (design/caos-expr.md, Phase 3): evaluating
# this directory yields the test's ARG TREE, which dev/run-test then runs.
#
# A WORKER TEST. The claim is about what the CANONICAL EVENT HEAD retains —
# the real merge ancestry, not just llm-step's result object — and that is a
# ref on the server. The client curried the turn and blocked on it.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/worker-test --worker1:@=worker.sh --llm-step:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-step --stub:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-stub --tool:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-test-tool --common:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-test/worker-common.sh
